==German==
===Etymology===
Iterative formation to the obsolete {{m|de|stochen}}, from {{bor|de|gml|stōken|t=to stoke}}, ultimately from the root of {{m|de|stoßen|t=to shove, thrust}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|de|De-stochern.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# to [[pick]], to [[poke]]
#: {{ux|de|Er '''stocherte''' lustlos in seinem Essen herum.|He '''poked''' around halfheartedly in his food.}}

